# BUG-288 batch 2: a CALL expression must carry a source position.
#
# Companion to bug288_binary_span_fail. PCall had no position field, so a
# diagnostic anchored on the call itself reported column 0. Two fixtures rather
# than one because binary derives its span from an operand and a call derives it
# from the callee — different arms, and a fix to one does not imply the other.
def g(): int
    return 1

def f(): str
    return g()

def main()
    print(f())
